│  the command handler tables for the whole 4-bit opcode space (16 entries)    │
│  with an explicit, commented slot per type so a missing entry is deliberate  │
│  rather than accidental, and make both lookup sites bound the index and      │
│  treat a NULL entry as a protocol error instead of calling through it. As    │
